Package: strainflow
Title: Multi-Signal Strain Transmission Analysis for Mother-Child Microbiome Studies
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("First", "Last", , "first.last@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "YOUR-ORCID-ID"))
Description: An integrated pipeline for characterizing bacterial strain transmission
    between mothers and children using longitudinal shotgun metagenomics. Combines
    inStrain (SNV-based) and SynTracker (synteny-based) strain comparison with novel
    analytical modules including a multi-signal transmission classifier, a transmission
    vs. environmental acquisition model, and a longitudinal strain dynamics engine.
